TradePilot is an algorithmic trading educational, simulation, and execution
research platform designed for developer and quantitative evaluation.

1. NO FINANCIAL ADVICE: Nothing contained in this codebase, documentation,
   or user interface constitutes financial, investment, legal, or tax advice.
   Cryptocurrency and derivatives trading involve substantial risk of loss and
   are not suitable for all investors.

2. SIMULATED TOKENS: The default internal tokens ("TradePilot Tokens", nominal
   INR value) are educational simulation credits for testing strategies,
   risk-management boundaries, and execution models without capital risk. They
   represent no claim on monetary funds, have no legal tender status, and
   cannot be redeemed for fiat currency.

3. USER CREDENTIAL SECURITY: Users are solely responsible for provisioning,
   safeguarding, and maintaining their own Delta Exchange API credentials and
   secrets. Never commit or expose private API keys in public repositories or
   client-side code.
